@startuml rechazarGuia-diseño
title Diagrama de Secuencia - Rechazar Guía

actor "DirectorGrado" as DirectorGrado
participant "Vista (React)" as Vista
participant "API (FastAPI)" as API
participant "GuiaRepository" as GuiaRepo
participant "Guia" as Guia
participant "HistorialCambio" as HistorialCambio
database "Base de Datos" as DB

DirectorGrado -> Vista: introduce comentario (opcional), solicita rechazar
activate Vista
Vista -> API: POST /api/v1/guias/{guia_id}/rechazar (comentario)
activate API

API -> GuiaRepo: obtener(guia_id)
activate GuiaRepo
GuiaRepo -> DB: SELECT ... FROM guias WHERE id = :guia_id
activate DB
DB --> GuiaRepo: fila Guia
deactivate DB
GuiaRepo --> API: Guia
deactivate GuiaRepo

API -> Guia: rechazar()
activate Guia
note right of Guia: transición EnRevision -> Rechazada,\nsegún su propia máquina de estados
deactivate Guia

API -> HistorialCambio: registrar("estado", "EnRevision", "Rechazada", comentario)
activate HistorialCambio
HistorialCambio --> API: HistorialCambio
deactivate HistorialCambio

API -> GuiaRepo: actualizar(guia)
activate GuiaRepo
GuiaRepo -> DB: UPDATE guias SET estado = 'Rechazada' ...
activate DB
DB --> GuiaRepo: ok
deactivate DB
GuiaRepo --> API: Guia
deactivate GuiaRepo

API --> Vista: 200 OK (GuiaResponse JSON, con historial)
deactivate API
Vista --> DirectorGrado: "GUÍA RECHAZADA" -- EnRevision -> Rechazada
deactivate Vista

@enduml
